{"4218800": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Nothing's Ever Really Dead", "steam_appid": 4218800, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this cyberpunk point-and-click mystery, Rex stands accused of the unthinkable: murdering his best friend, Sara. To clear his name, he must partner with the victim herself — or rather, her wisecracking ghost — to expose conspiracies and determine his own fate. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4218800/extras/d3bd993e88e0e6153d6af62badd7dff5.poster.avif?t=1783420658\" width=616 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4218800/extras/d3bd993e88e0e6153d6af62badd7dff5.webm?t=1783420658\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4218800/extras/d3bd993e88e0e6153d6af62badd7dff5.mp4?t=1783420658\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>WELCOME TO DISTRICT 13</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is an adventure game inspired by the classics. Explore the city of Neo Manchester. Solve puzzles and mysteries. Have fun chats with interesting people. Clear your name!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4218800/extras/b9cd714c091b3287e2bc2d289c9edf27.poster.avif?t=1783420658\" width=616 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4218800/extras/b9cd714c091b3287e2bc2d289c9edf27.webm?t=1783420658\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=v